#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/status/software-verification.md:0
msgid "旧的精确代码执行；不是当前代码／文档 HEAD 自动继承的资格"
msgstr ""
"Earlier exact-code execution; no qualification automatically inherited by "
"current code/documentation HEAD"

#: ../../../../tmp/nexus-quality-20261019/docs/status/software-verification.md:27
msgid ""
"成功打包后，公开站点和离线包的 manifest 由实际构建输入生成。Git HEAD 可以因文档提交改变； 这里不手填一个很快漂移的 HEAD "
"常量。未打包的工作树可执行 `git rev-parse HEAD` 核对 checkout，但命令输出本身不是 qualification "
"receipt。"
msgstr ""
"After successful packaging, manifests for the public site and offline "
"package derive from actual build inputs. Documentation commits may change "
"Git HEAD; this page does not manually insert a rapidly drifting HEAD "
"constant. An unpackaged working tree can run `git rev-parse HEAD` to check "
"its checkout, but that command output alone is not a qualification receipt."

